title:: BMMasterFaderGUI
summary:: Documentation BEASTmulch - GUI for a BMMasterFader
categories:: Classes

Description::

See also: link::Classes/Root Classes/BMAbstractGUI::, link::Classes/Inputs and Outputs/BMMasterFader::

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: new
Create a new BMMasterFaderGUI.
		
argument:: masterFader
An instance of BMMasterFader.
argument:: name
An optional String or Symbol indicating the title of the window. If nil is passed the name of masterFader will be used.


Examples::

code::
f = BMMasterFader.new;
g = BMMasterFaderGUI(f, "MF");
f.level = -6;
g.close; f.free;
::
